## What Is the F88 Form?

The **F88 Customs Declaration Form** is the official document travelers must complete when entering Kenya with goods subject to import duty — including mobile phones. Devices valued over **KES 10,000 (approx. USD 77)** must be listed on this form.

| Traveler Type | Requirement |
|---|---|
