- IMEI number(s)
- Estimated market value (USD or KES)
- Country of purchase

**Step 4 — Submit to a KRA officer.** Hand the completed form at the Red Channel desk. The officer verifies the IMEI against the national database.

**Step 5 — Receive clearance.** After verification and any applicable duty payment, you receive a **KRA IMEI clearance stamp** and your phone is registered in the **Communications Authority of Kenya (CA)** database.

