## Why the NCC Is Blocking Phones in Nigeria

The **Nigerian Communications Commission (NCC)** launched a major crackdown on counterfeit, substandard, and unapproved mobile devices. Phones that do not carry a valid **NCC Type Approval** certificate — and whose IMEIs are not registered in the national database — are being progressively blocked from MTN Nigeria, Airtel Nigeria, Glo, and 9mobile networks.

