## Pourquoi Vérifier l'IMEI de Votre Téléphone au Sénégal?

Le marché des téléphones au Sénégal est dynamique et risqué. À Dakar, les marchés de **Sandaga**, de **HLM** et de **Colobane** proposent des milliers d'appareils d'occasion — dont beaucoup proviennent d'Europe ou d'Asie sans vérification de leur statut légal.

Senegal's mobile phone market is vibrant but carries real risks. Markets in Dakar's Sandaga, HLM, and Colobane districts offer thousands of secondhand devices — many imported from Europe or Asia without any verification of their legal status. The **ARTP** (Autorité de Régulation des Télécommunications et des Postes) is Senegal's telecom regulator, overseeing IMEI compliance on networks operated by Orange Sénégal, Free Sénégal (Expresso), and Sonatel.

Buying a blacklisted phone is one of the most common and costly mistakes buyers in Senegal make. This guide shows you how to avoid it.

## L'IMEI — Qu'est-ce que c'est? / What Is an IMEI?

Every mobile phone has a unique **IMEI (International Mobile Equipment Identity)** — a 15-digit number that identifies your device on every network worldwide. Think of it as the phone's "serial number" and "passport" combined.

- An IMEI on the **Whitelist**: device is legitimate and can connect to any network
- An IMEI on the **Greylist**: device has a compliance issue — limited service
- An IMEI on the **Blacklist**: device is reported stolen or fraudulent — completely blocked

## Comment Trouver l'IMEI de Votre Téléphone / How to Find Your IMEI

| Méthode / Method | Instructions |
|---|---|
| Code USSD | Composez `*#06#` / Dial `*#06#` |
| Android | Paramètres › À propos › IMEI / Settings › About › IMEI |
| iPhone | Paramètres › Général › Informations / Settings › General › About |
| Boîte du téléphone | L'IMEI est imprimé sur l'étiquette / Printed on the label |
| Tiroir SIM | Sur les iPhones récents, l'IMEI figure sur le tiroir SIM |

## Vérification IMEI au Sénégal / IMEI Verification in Senegal

### Étape 1 — Vérification de base / Basic Check

Use our [Free IMEI Check](https://imeihub.net/service.php?slug=free-imei-check) to instantly get:
- Marque et modèle de l'appareil (iPhone, Samsung, Xiaomi, etc.)
- Confirmation de la validité de l'IMEI (algorithme de Luhn)
- Informations techniques (capacité de stockage, couleur, fréquences)

### Étape 2 — Vérification de la liste noire / Blacklist Verification

Our [WorldWide Blacklist Check](https://imeihub.net/service.php?slug=blacklist) searches international databases:
- **Réseaux français**: Orange France, SFR, Bouygues Telecom, Free Mobile
- **Réseaux britanniques**: EE, O2, Vodafone UK, Three
- **Base de données GSMA** (couverture mondiale / global coverage)
- **Réseaux américains**: AT&T, T-Mobile, Verizon

Since many phones in Senegal come from France or the UK, checking these networks is especially important.

### Étape 3 — Vérification ARTP / ARTP Check

Contact the ARTP at **artp.sn** or call **+221 33 869 00 00** to check the status of a device's import declaration. Commercial importers are required to register device manifests with the ARTP.

## Téléphones Importés — Ce Que Vous Devez Savoir

### Téléphones apportés de France

Many Senegalese residents bring phones back from France. These are legal as long as:
- The phone is not **opérateur-locked** (or has been unlocked before traveling)
- The phone is not on the **French operator blacklist**
- The phone is for **personal use** (not commercial resale)

Always run a [WorldWide Blacklist Check](https://imeihub.net/service.php?slug=blacklist) before traveling — you don't want to arrive in Dakar with a blocked phone.

### Téléphones commandés sur AliExpress / Amazon

Custom duty applies to phones valued over **75,000 FCFA** imported into Senegal. Declare at customs (douane) upon arrival. Phones from these platforms are frequently legitimate but always verify the IMEI before paying the vendor.

## Risques du Marché de l'Occasion / Used Market Risks

| Scénario | Risque / Risk |
|---|---|
| iPhone à prix bradé au marché HLM | Probablement volé en Europe / Likely stolen in Europe |
| Samsung Galaxy sans boîte ni facture | Statut inconnu — vérifiez absolument / Unknown status — always check |
