## ceir.gov.mm — Myanmar's Official IMEI Registration Portal

The **ceir.gov.mm** portal is operated by the **Post and Telecommunications Department (PTD / ဆက်သွယ်ရေးဌာန)**. It is the only official platform for registering mobile devices in Myanmar. All registration done through unofficial agents or third-party websites is fraudulent.

This tutorial walks you through the complete registration process in English with key Burmese terms included, so you can navigate the portal confidently.

## မစတင်မီ လိုအပ်သောအရာများ / What You Need Before You Start

Prepare these items before opening the portal:

| Item | Details |
|---|---|
| NRC / Passport | မှတ်ပုံတင် or valid foreign passport |
| Phone IMEI(s) | Dial `*#06#` — note both IMEIs if dual-SIM |
| Purchase receipt | Original or clear photo/scan |
| Phone with SIM active | You need to receive an OTP during registration |
| Internet connection | Any browser on mobile or computer works |

## Step 1 — Access the Portal / ပေါ်တယ်သို့ ဝင်ရောက်ပါ

1. Open your browser and go to **ceir.gov.mm**
2. On the homepage, you will see two main options:
   - **"IMEI စစ်ဆေးမည်"** — Check IMEI status
   - **"မှတ်ပုံတင်မည်"** — Register a device
3. Click **"မှတ်ပုံတင်မည်"** to begin registration

*Before registering, always check if your phone is already in the system. Click "IMEI စစ်ဆေးမည်" first.*

## Step 2 — Create or Log In to Your Account

**New users:**
1. Click **"အကောင့်ဖွင့်ပါ"** (Create Account)
2. Enter your NRC number in the format: **12/မကန(နိုင်)123456** or your passport number
3. Enter your active phone number (the SIM inside the phone you are registering)
4. Set a secure password
5. Verify your phone number with the OTP sent by SMS

**Returning users:**
Log in with your NRC/passport and password.

## Step 3 — Enter Device Information / ဖုန်းအချက်အလက်ထည့်ပါ

After logging in, select **"Register New Device"**:

1. **IMEI 1**: Enter the first IMEI exactly as displayed by `*#06#`
2. **IMEI 2**: If dual-SIM, enter the second IMEI (leave blank if single-SIM)
3. **Brand / ကုမ္ပဏီ**: Select from dropdown (Apple, Samsung, OPPO, Vivo, Xiaomi, etc.)
4. **Model / မော်ဒယ်**: Select the specific model (e.g., Samsung Galaxy A55)
5. **Purchase Date / ဝယ်ယူသည့်နေ့**: Enter date in DD/MM/YYYY format
6. **Color / အရောင်**: Select from dropdown

